0.html","attDownloadType":0,"title":"2026上海合作组织传统医学论坛开幕","type":0,"pubDate":"2026-09-18 09:40","relation":0,"urls":"{\"news\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/news/content/2101849046290870272/content_2101849046290870272.html\",\"pc\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/content/content_2101849046290870272.html\"}","contentSource":"江西省人民政府","showTitle":"<p>2026上海合作组织传统医学论坛开幕</p>","topStatus":0,"archiveStatus":0,"sortNum":17899548000014444,"id":"2101849046290870272","articleFiles":[{}]},{"classify":0,"images":[{}],"metadata":{},"relationUrl":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/relation/2097910360528465920-RelationArticle.json","attDownloadType":0,"title":"省卫生健康委召开党组（扩大）会议 总结树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育工作","type":0,"pubDate":"2026-09-09 17:48","relation":0,"urls":"{\"news\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/news/content/2097910360528465920/content_2097910360528465920.html\",\"pc\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/content/content_2097910360528465920.html\"}","contentSource":"江西省卫生健康委员会","showTitle":"省卫生健康委召开党组（扩大）会议 总结树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育工作","topStatus":0,"archiveStatus":0,"sortNum":17889472800012216,"id":"2097910360528465920","articleFiles":[{}]},{"classify":0,"images":[{"cover":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/2096123677831147520/DQwoxfUJ.png","filePath":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/2096123677831147520/DQwoxfUJ.png","domainName":"http://hc.jiangxi.gov.cn","delFlag":0,"fileId":"2096121495698182144"}],"metadata":{},"relationUrl":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/relation/2096123677831147520-RelationArticle.json","attDownloadType":0,"title":"王仁辉在景德镇调研卫生健康工作","type":0,"pubDate":"2026-09-04 18:19","relation":0,"urls":"{\"news\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/news/content/2096123677831147520/content_2096123677831147520.html\",\"pc\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/content/content_2096123677831147520.html\"}","contentSource":"江西省卫生健康委员会","showTitle":"王仁辉在景德镇调研卫生健康工作","topStatus":0,"archiveStatus":0,"sortNum":17885171400093316,"id":"2096123677831147520","articleFiles":[{}]},{"classify":0,"images":[{"cover":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/2095320277409411072/LHTbUTuv.png","filePath":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/2095320277409411072/LHTbUTuv.png","domainName":"http://hc.jiangxi.gov.cn","delFlag":0,"fileId":"2095320008369803264"}],"metadata":{},"relationUrl":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/relation/2095320277409411072-RelationArticle.json","attDownloadType":0,"title":"王仁辉调研省中医药研究院、省职业病防治研究院","type":0,"pubDate":"2026-09-02 18:15","relation":0,"urls":"{\"news\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/news/content/2095320277409411072/content_2095320277409411072.html\",\"pc\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/content/content_2095320277409411072.html\"}","contentSource":"江西省卫生健康委员会","showTitle":"王仁辉调研省中医药研究院、省职业病防治研究院","topStatus":0,"archiveStatus":0,"sortNum":17883441000078463,"id":"2095320277409411072","articleFiles":[{}]},{"summary":"8月31日，省委书记尹弘主持召开专题会议，研究大健康产业培育发展工作。他强调，要深入贯彻习近平总书记关于健康中国重要论述，立足资源禀赋与产业基础，聚焦更好满足人民群众对美好生活的向往，发挥独特优势，精准发力突破，积极培育新技术新产品新模式新业态，加快推动大健康产业高质量发展。","classify":0,"images":[{"cover":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/2094589598300188672/kAw81Jk7.jpg","fileName":"1jpg_副本.jpg","domainName":"http://hc.jiangxi.gov.cn","filePath":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/2094589598300188672/kAw81Jk7.jpg","delFlag":0,"type":"1","fileId":"2094587633239232512"}],"metadata":{"ThdTitle":"尹弘在专题研究大健康产业培育发展工作时强调","LinkTitle":"<p>发挥独特优势 精准发力突破 积极培育新技术新产品新模式新业态 加快推动大健康产业高质量发展</p>"},"relationUrl":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/relation/2094589598300188672-RelationArticle.json","author":"文/魏星 摄影/海波","attDownloadType":0,"title":"发挥独特优势 精准发力突破 加快推动大健康产业高质量发展","type":0,"pubDate":"2026-09-01 08:43","relation":0,"urls":"{\"news\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/news/content/2094589598300188672/content_2094589598300188672.html\",\"pc\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/content/content_2094589598300188672.html\"}","contentSource":"江西日报","showTitle":"<p>尹弘主持召开专题会议 研究大健康产业培育发展工作</p>","topStatus":0,"archiveStatus":0,"sortNum":17882233800071859,"id":"2094589598300188672","articleFiles":[{}]},{"classify":0,"images":[{}],"metadata":{},"relationUrl":"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/relation/2092151146907246592-RelationArticle.json","attDownloadType":0,"title":"省卫生健康委党组理论学习中心组开展习近平党建思想专题学习","type":0,"pubDate":"2026-08-24 17:23","relation":0,"urls":"{\"news\":\"/jxswsjkwyh/jkyw/news/con